[{"title":"寄陈光庭效尧夫体","author":"邹元标","text":"济济衣冠聚一堂，须怜道脉类亡羊。\n纲常万古天难泯，师友千秋谊不忘。\n弱草纷纷随逝水，寒松郁郁自严霜。\n振衣直上高台望，骀荡春风遍八荒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22115,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"看月怀陈光庭","author":"邹元标","text":"皓魄凌霄夜睡迟，科头松下漫支颐。\n光涵天地堪谁说，影动鱼龙祗自知。\n露下风高看斗转，庭空木落听蛩悲。\n会心人远空陈迹，千载嗒然忆惠施。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22116,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"别少原余明府","author":"邹元标","text":"春风澹荡送行舟，花满禾阳得胜游。\n阖邑桑麻沾雨露，邻封童叟起歌讴。\n家传安道源流远，政类中牟惠泽稠。\n下榻不禁明发去，壮心欲折大江头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22117,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"鹭洲胜会以病阻赴漫占二首 其一","author":"邹元标","text":"懒慢山中学耦耕，丁丁伐木忆同声。\n天开章贡千年会，人卧衡庐百感生。\n未许春风分半席，独将明月拥孤城。\n从来鹭水澄澄绿，好向江门共濯缨。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22118,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"鹭洲胜会以病阻赴漫占二首 其二","author":"邹元标","text":"东风吹动万回青，夜送花香扑满庭。\n野鸟间关还解语，青山突兀对传经。\n少年碣石高谭麈，老去江湖是客星。\n独往独来无一事，大夫不是醉为醒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22119,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"访刘静之光禄","author":"邹元标","text":"怪来何事不相容，久别那堪意气慵。\n春到莺声求友切，斋悬榻影带云封。\n萧萧华发还同社，渺渺苍波任去踪。\n松竹岁寒吾敢负，不妨时醉酒家佣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22120,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"桐江晤徐献和廉访使","author":"邹元标","text":"三十馀年老弟兄，相思几度梦魂惊。\n忽闻青雀云间至，不觉幽怀座上倾。\n世味尝来偏磊磈，人情阅处太纵横。\n匡庐乞得閒身地，岁晚相期共耦耕。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22121,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"少白先生归三吴","author":"邹元标","text":"原是清朝执戟臣，翻然孤艇度迷津。\n乍看紫气神偏王，久听玄谭意自真。\n笔底青山堪寄老，腰间宝剑未为贫。\n悬知别后遥相忆，江草江花入梦频。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22122,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄谢李廉访题仁文书院","author":"邹元标","text":"西山凝望耸岧峣，宪府中开爽气摇。\n历乱鹅群随綵笔，蹁跹凤翥下青霄。\n河滨岂合当题品，院宇真看动斗杓。\n千载伫瞻从此始，况堪棠荫见文饶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22123,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题阳明先生像六首 其一","author":"邹元标","text":"登坛济济说良知，不著丝毫更数谁。\n抛却语言诸伎俩，日星千古自昭垂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22124,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题阳明先生像六首 其二","author":"邹元标","text":"群贤列圣无他语，惟一惟精只此中。\n腊底雪消山尽处，柴门夜夜领春风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22125,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题阳明先生像六首 其三","author":"邹元标","text":"辛苦平生几问津，迟回歧路倍伤神。\n于今识得先生面，野草閒花一样春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22126,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题阳明先生像六首 其四","author":"邹元标","text":"吾心宇宙有同然，却道金溪是学禅。\n不是先生勤指点，谁令吾道日中天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22127,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题阳明先生像六首 其五","author":"邹元标","text":"吾乡先辈盛流传，疑信相参苦未坚。\n踏破草鞋无觅处，始知吾道有真诠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22128,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题阳明先生像六首 其六","author":"邹元标","text":"人疑此道大圆通，规矩方圆妙不穷。\n效地法天无两事，圆神方智总吾宗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22129,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"仁文席上有破瓮者","author":"邹元标","text":"斯道天开万象陈，根荄枝叶总吾真。\n诸君欲问传心者，请听街前击瓮人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22130,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"自警二首 其一","author":"邹元标","text":"收敛精神入太虚，终朝兀兀总如愚。\n老来不识原头路，只恐青山也笑予。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22131,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"自警二首 其二","author":"邹元标","text":"今朝不知明朝事，肯效人间寿者痴。\n若要了时即便了，乾坤伶俐几男儿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22132,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送龙紫海侍御之秦二首 其一","author":"邹元标","text":"秦川自古帝王州，此日乘骢亦壮游。\n莫道匈奴今远避，黄沙莽莽使人愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22133,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送龙紫海侍御之秦二首 其二","author":"邹元标","text":"三月莺花江上行，大宛万马自逢迎。\n骊歌不唱阳关曲，鹭水悠悠万里情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22134,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"龙华寺旧谭道处也归来不觉愯然辄成四绝情见于辞时自都匀环归 其一","author":"邹元标","text":"十年不到龙华寺，归卧山僧旧草亭。\n笑予漂泊西南久，消得楞严几卷经。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22135,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"龙华寺旧谭道处也归来不觉愯然辄成四绝情见于辞时自都匀环归 其二","author":"邹元标","text":"眼前事业岂为真，世上浮名几误人。\n寄语芸窗年少者，莫将章句送青春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22136,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"龙华寺旧谭道处也归来不觉愯然辄成四绝情见于辞时自都匀环归 其三","author":"邹元标","text":"当年碣石谭天友，白雪泠泠一代才。\n长望青霄人去远，孤身独绕法王台。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22137,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"龙华寺旧谭道处也归来不觉愯然辄成四绝情见于辞时自都匀环归 其四","author":"邹元标","text":"拟向山中学耦耕，归来犹自急王程。\n莫将猿鹤移文诮，须鉴当年报主情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22138,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠唐仁卿 其一","author":"邹元标","text":"知君试政数年前，把臂金陵岂偶然。\n此别应须各努力，莫将閒语负前贤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22139,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠唐仁卿 其二","author":"邹元标","text":"千圣相传只此心，夫君何事外头寻。\n雷风露雨无非教，休向沙头只漫吟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22140,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠唐仁卿 其三","author":"邹元标","text":"谁道文编是学陈，陈王学脉定谁真。\n停轺如过江门里，碧玉楼前春草新。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22141,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠谢磐谷山人 其一","author":"邹元标","text":"棱棱丰骨自天成，老向长安觅友生。\n座上不须弹法指，庭前菉竹已同声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22142,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠谢磐谷山人 其二","author":"邹元标","text":"堪怜四世老箕裘，白发萧萧亦壮游。\n尘世相看成独往，几人端不为身谋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22143,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"马上吟 其一","author":"邹元标","text":"时逢閒处练元神，过眼浮荣未是真。\n雨散云消浑不碍，山河大地露全身。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22144,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"马上吟 其二","author":"邹元标","text":"忘思忘虑意閒閒，莫道风尘老客颜。\n独往独来无一事，垂鞭马首看西山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22145,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"出都门谩吟 其一","author":"邹元标","text":"萧萧行李去匆匆，人拟前身是晦翁。\n还少当年十二考，冰壶秋月此心同。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22146,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"出都门谩吟 其二","author":"邹元标","text":"平生踪迹使人疑，一片丹心祗自知。\n雪搅长空人语少，且携妻子共流离。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22147,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"出都门谩吟 其三","author":"邹元标","text":"自笑逢迎百不能，人间好汉亦相憎。\n萍踪到处曾飘泊，游宦恰如行脚僧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22148,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谩吟六首 其一","author":"邹元标","text":"浮云抉破青天开，撒手悬崖万丈台。\n悟后浑然无一事，无修原自有修来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22149,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谩吟六首 其二","author":"邹元标","text":"廿年踪迹遍穷途，到处人间费浪呼。\n今日猛然无可道，不妨人笑是痴愚。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv