 其二","author":"邹元标","text":"文水潆回绕故城，几呼渔父盏同倾。\n醉来搔首忘机事，独上冈头看月明。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22169,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和周吏部海门公韵 其三","author":"邹元标","text":"壁间时挂不弦琴，风度泠泠万古心。\n我欲一弹山水调，却嫌人拟太高深。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22170,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和周吏部海门公韵 其四","author":"邹元标","text":"閒眠饱食只寻常，不用人间费忖量。\n欲向虚空弹一指，却疑傀儡此登场。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22171,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和周吏部海门公韵 其五","author":"邹元标","text":"纷纷异说总纵横，春到园林万木生。\n檐角风传天籁处，有声谁听到无声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22172,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和周吏部海门公韵 其六","author":"邹元标","text":"每临秋水情偏淡，兴揽千山迹不孤。\n欲赠夫君难寄取，临风倍觉一言无。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22173,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和周吏部海门公韵 其七","author":"邹元标","text":"江门渔父老渔矶，笋蕨山中生事微。\n莫道小臣忘报主，春风时舞芰荷衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22174,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"丁酉元旦口占","author":"邹元标","text":"春色光芒映太玄，梅花吾意共相传